- Null follicle aspiration\n - History of chemotherapy [OR] or radiotherapy<|eot_id|>']
Response: Inclusion Criteria:
 - 18-35-year-old women
 - BMI: >18 [AND] and < 30 kg/m2
 - Normal female karyotype
 - Normal uterus [AND] and ovaries at transvaginal ultrasound
Exclusion Criteria:
