t Nice University Hospital\nExclusion Criteria:\n - Children [AND] with congenital pathologies (with malformations in the oro-facial sphere)\n - Children [AND] with neurological [OR] and developmental pathologies unrelated to prematurity\n - Children [AND] with ENT deformities\n - Parental langage barrier<|eot_id|>']
