 disease or congestive heart failure； ④Severe liver and kidney dysfunction;\n\n### Response:\nInclusion Criteria:\n - [NOT] Non-cardiac surgery patients;\n - Age is greater than or equal to 60 years old; ③Han Nationality, mother tongue is chinese; ④The MMSE score:Illiteracy is greater than or equal to 17 points, primary school is greater than or equal to 20 points, higher secondary school is more than 24 points; ⑤The people signed informed consent.\nExclusion Criteria:\n - The diagnosis of preoperative delirium；\n - The diagnosis Unstable hypertension（Such as：pheochromocytoma [OR] or aortic dissection）； ③Severe chronic obstructive pulmonary disease [OR] or congestive heart failure； ④Severe liver [OR] and kidney dysfunction;<|eot_id|>']
