nic with chronic ankle pain [AND] and suspected clinically to have impingement syndrome.\nExclusion Criteria:\n 1. Inflammatory arthritis of ankle joint, infection in ankle joint, [OR] neoplasm around ankle joint.\n 2. Patients with contraindications for MRI, e.g. an implanted magnetic device, [OR] pacemakers [OR] or claustrophobia.<|eot_id|>']
